LEETCODE 767. Reorganize String
Given a string s, rearrange the characters of s so that any two adjacent characters are not the same.
Return any possible rearrangement of s or return "" if not possible.
Example 1:
Input: s = "aab" 
Output: "aba"

Example 2:
Input: s = "aaab"
Output: ""
FIRST SOLUTION:
ALGORITHM:
🧠 Algorithm – Reorganize String (Heap Scheduling)
Algorithm Steps
• Count frequency of each character using HashMap.
• Insert all (character, frequency) pairs into a max heap (PriorityQueue).
• While heap size is ≥ 2:
Remove two characters with highest frequency.
Append both characters to the result string.
Decrease their frequencies by 1.
If any character still has remaining count, reinsert it into heap.
• If heap has one element left:
If its remaining frequency is greater than 1 → return empty string.
Else append the character and finish.
• Return the result string.
FIRST SOLUTION: TIME COMPLEXITY:O(N log K) || SPACE COMPLEXITY:O(N)
class Pair{
    private char key;
    private int value;
    Pair(char kee,int val)
    {
        this.key=kee;
        this.value=val;
    }
    public char getKee(){
        return key;
    }
    public int getVal(){
        return value;
    }
}
class Solution {
    public String reorganizeString(String s) {
        String result="";
        Map<Character,Integer> mapp=new HashMap<>();
        PriorityQueue<Pair> pq=new PriorityQueue<>((a,b) -> b.getVal() - a.getVal() );
        Pair frstTemp=null,scndTemp=null;
        for(int i=0;i<s.length();i++)
        {
            if(mapp.containsKey(s.charAt(i)))
            {
                mapp.put(s.charAt(i),(mapp.get(s.charAt(i))+1));
            }
            else
            {
                mapp.put(s.charAt(i),1);  
            }
        }
        for(Map.Entry<Character,Integer> entry:mapp.entrySet())
        {
            pq.add(new Pair(entry.getKey(),entry.getValue()));
        }
        while(pq.size()>=2)
        {
            frstTemp=pq.poll();
            scndTemp=pq.poll();
            result=result+frstTemp.getKee();
            result=result+scndTemp.getKee();
            if(frstTemp.getVal()-1!=0)
            {
                pq.add(new Pair(frstTemp.getKee(),frstTemp.getVal()-1));
            }
            if(scndTemp.getVal()-1!=0)
            {
                pq.add(new Pair(scndTemp.getKee(),scndTemp.getVal()-1));
            }
        }
        if(pq.size()!=0)
        {
        frstTemp=pq.poll();
        if(frstTemp.getVal()-1!=0)
        {
            result="";
        }
        else
        {
            result=result+frstTemp.getKee();
        }
        }
        return result;
    }
}
